#: ../chapter6.rst:50
msgid "You can attach local (from your Client Device) folders to |prodname| by clicking the \"Attached Folders\" button **(1)**. In the main view, and then click \"Attach a Local Folder to the Cloud\" **(2)**. This will open a wizard. Type in the location of the folder in the provided field or click the \"...\" button **(3)** to explore to a folder you wish to attach **(4)**. Click \"Attach\" to complete the process."
